1995 年起）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["Chen T, Kalra A, Sun B (2009). Why Do Consumers Buy Extended Service Contracts? Journal of Consumer Research 36(4):611-623. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.1086/605298","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://doi.org/10.1086/605298"]},"；国家经贸委等 (1995). 部分商品修理更换退货责任规定（国经贸〔1995〕458 号，第八条三包有效期自开具发票之日起计算；附件《实施三包的部分商品目录（第一批）》洗衣机、家用电冰箱整机 1 年、主要部件 3 年）. 国家市场监督管理总局行政规范性文件. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/zc/xzgfxwj/art/2019/art_f943e66de125437d92df701e1654c47c.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.samr.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgk/zc/xzgfxwj/art/2019/art_f943e66de125437d92df701e1654c47c.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["毛利率那个数字是论文引用别人的行业估算（Business Week 2004），不是论文自己测出来的。上面的算法适用于自己掏得起一次维修费的普通人。靠一台设备吃饭、又没有备用机的人，要另外算。手机碎屏险这一类也要单独算：先估自己多久摔一次，再看保费划不划算。很便宜的延保买了也亏不了几十元。买之前先看清从哪天开始算：从买的那天算的，头几年和三包重叠。再看是商家、品牌还是第三方公司在保，上门费和换件费另不另收。说明书和保修卡也翻一下，品牌自己承诺的保修期可能比三包长。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/05-10"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 1